    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "****UNDER OFFER****\r\nCoastal Charm & Endless Potential on Ballybunion's Famous Cliff Walk!\r\nNestled in a highly sought-after location along Doon Bay Road, this detached 3-bedroom bungalow offers a rare lifestyle opportunity with immediate access to Ballybunion’s world-famous beaches, breathtaking cliff walks, and vibrant seaside amenities. The original character of the pitched slate roof blends with a selection of flat-roof extensions added over the years, creating a unique layout that comprises a kitchen, dining room, living room, bathroom, garage, and functional storage stores. Set on an exceptionally spacious 770 sq.m. site wrapped in secure walled boundaries and mature privacy hedging, this property exudes coastal charm while serving as the ultimate blank canvas for renovation or expansion. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised to truly appreciate the unparalleled location and endless potential on offer - please call Dillon Prendiville Auctioneers 068-21739."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch & Hallway - 3.0m x 1.6m \r\nSliding patio door and tiled floor - window overlooking the front garden.\r\n\r\nCorridor - 3.2m x 1.2m \r\nTiled floor.\r\n\r\nShower Room - 2.4m x 2.3m \r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling and level access shower.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.3m x 3.2m \r\n\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.6m x 4.5m \r\nTongue and groove flooring and solid fuel open fireplace - windows overlooking the front garden and Ballybunion seaside.\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.7m x 4.6m \r\nLarge window overlooking the front garden, solid fuel open fireplace and built-in wardrobes floor to ceiling.\r\n\r\nDining Room - 2.7m x 4.0m \r\nTongue and grooved flooring, solid fuel open fireplace and window overlooking the rear courtyard\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 4.5m x 3.4m \r\nTongue and grooved flooring and rear window overlooking courtyard.\r\n\r\nSide Entrance - 2.2m x 1.5m \r\nWith built-in cloak - access from a small courtyard off the side entrance with outdoor toilet.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 3.0m x 4.8m \r\nTongue and grooved flooring, solid fuel stove, fully fitted kitchen with granite worktop and Belfast sink.\r\n\r\nPantry/Storeroom - 2.6m x 2.3m \r\n\r\n\r\nRear Entrance Lobby - 1.9m x 1.8m \r\nWith oil boiler, plumbed for washing machine and access to rear yard.\r\n\r\nLean-to Store - 9.1m x 4.6m \r\nConcrete floor and asbestos roof - pedestrian access to Doon Bay Road.\r\n\r\nLock-up Store - 1.0m x 1.5m \r\nWith concrete roof.\r\n\r\nGarage - 5.5m x 3.0m \r\nVehicle access door off Doon Bay Road and pedestrian access to side courtyard.\r\n\r\nLean-to - 4.6m x 3.3m \r\nPotting shed - looking onto the front garden.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Location, location, location.\r\nHighly sought after location along Doon Bay Road leading to the beautiful cliff walk.\r\nImmediate access to Ballybunion Beach, Cliff house Hotel, town centre and all amenities.\r\nThe dwelling is of masonry construction with pitched slate roof and a selection of flat roofs.\r\nDouble glazed PVC windows\r\nThe house is partially finished with an external cozy wrap insulation.\r\nAll public main services connected.\r\nThe property oozes charm and offers the discerning buyer an opportunity to acquire a very unique property."
      },
      {
